  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEFs arbete inom prim&#xe4;rutbildning i norra Afghanistan omfattar de  fyra provinserna Balkh, Jowzjan, Samangan och Sar-e Pul. Fokus &#xe4;r     framf&#xf6;r allt att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r flickor att f&#xe5; g&#xe5; i skolan, etablera  skolor p&#xe5; byniv&#xe5;, bygga och utrusta skolor, vidareutbilda l&#xe4;rare samt bedriva alfabetiseringsundervisning f&#xf6;r unga kvinnor. Insatsen        omfattar enbart ett &#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEFs program for primary education in northern Afghanistan         includes the four provinces Balkh, Jowzjan, Samangan and Sar-e Pul.   The forucs if primarily to make it possible for girls to attend       school, establish community based education classes at village level, build and equip schools, capacity builiding of teachers and literacy  for young women. The agreement is for one year.</narrative>
  </description>
